      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a draft to consider for your policy memo.\n\nThis policy must support respectful discourse while strictly prohibiting political campaigning or aggressive debate in the professional environment. We should clearly define \"appropriate discussion,\" focusing on how political views are expressed, not the views themselves, to maintain a neutral stance. The policy should emphasize that all political commentary must be respectful and should not target specific individuals or the company in a partisan way to ensure an inclusive culture for everyone, regardless of belief.",
